# Cortex AI — ML Training / Evaluation Extras (Abstract Spec)
# ============================================================
# Install alongside the main production deps:
#   pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.lock \
#               --require-hashes -r requirements-ml-training.lock
#
# ⚠  SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH RULE
# The core ML/AI stack (tensorflow, torch, keras, onnx, onnxruntime-gpu,
# xgboost, optuna, scikit-learn, transformers, optimum, numpy, pandas) is
# pinned ONLY in requirements.in / requirements.lock.  Never re-pin it here.
# Doing so will silently downgrade the stack and may break TF GPU training.
#
# This file holds ONLY training/evaluation-time extras not present in
# requirements.in, validated against the locked core stack.

